  "summary": {
    "as": "Introduced in House",
    "asOf": "2025-09-26",
    "date": "2026-08-27T19:34:37Z",
    "text": "Literacy in Future Technologies Artificial Intelligence Act or the LIFT AI Act\n\nThis bill authorizes the National Science Foundation\u00a0to make merit-based grants to institutions of higher education, nonprofit organizations, and consortia of such entities to support artificial intelligence (AI) literacy for K-12 students and educators. Grants may be used for research and development of educational curricula, instructional material, professional development for teachers, and evaluation methods for AI literacy at the K-12 level."
  },
